&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop new ETL jobs to integrate product or business data into our warehouse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the performance and reliability of core pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reusable datasets that support experimentation, product and business analytics, or cross-functional stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
