&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the design from start to finish for impactful features that ship quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product, research, marketing, and other functions to identify user and business needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Engineering to ensure a high-quality implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create flows, prototypes, and high-fidelity visuals for your features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in weekly design critiques&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
