&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/figma/status/1920154721966547255&quot;&gt;Figma Grid&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.figma.com/blog/billing-experience-update-2025/&quot;&gt;Billing Experience&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
